---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Zircon" description="How Zircon handles the information you send through this website.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <article class="page">
      <p class="index">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy notice.</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated 31 October 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Zircon is an independent design and technology studio. You can reach us at&nbsp;
          <a href="mailto:zircn.dev@gmail.com">zircn.dev@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          If you use the contact form, we receive your name, your email address, the service you pick (optional) and
          the message you write. If you email us or message us on Instagram, we receive what you send.
        </p>
        <p>
          Like any website, our hosting and the form service may also process technical data such as your IP address
          while the page loads or the form is sent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Why we use it</h2>
        <p>
          Only to reply to you and, if you ask for it, to prepare a quote or start a project together. We do not send
          newsletters, sell your details, or use them for advertising.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Who handles it</h2>
        <p>
          Form messages pass through Web3Forms, a form service that delivers them to our email inbox. Our email is
          provided by Google (Gmail). The site is delivered by our hosting provider. These services process data on
          our behalf to make the website work.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site also loads its fonts from Google Fonts, which means your browser contacts Google's servers when the
          page opens.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep enquiries for up to 12 months. If a project goes ahead, we keep the records we need to do the work
          and to meet legal and accounting obligations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not use cookies for tracking, and it has no analytics or advertising tools. If that
          changes, we will update this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or object to how we use it. Write to&nbsp; 
          <a href="mailto:zircn.dev@gmail.com">zircn.dev@gmail.com</a> and we will respond. You also have the right to
          complain to your data protection authority. In Albania, that is the Commissioner for the Right to
          Information and Protection of Personal Data.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    width: min(46rem, calc(100% - 2 * var(--page-pad)));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: calc(var(--header-height) + 4rem) 0 var(--section-space);
  }

  .index {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6a6e78;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .updated {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  section p {
    color: #2b2d33;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  section p + p {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  a {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }
</style>
